 "short": false,
 "hook": "Busan International Film Festival: 31st edition",
 "name_chips": true,
 "lines": [
  {
   "who": "anchor",
   "text": "But if you like your art with subtitles, head south. The Busan International Film Festival, October sixth to fifteenth.",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_034.mp3",
   "shot": "k_screen",
   "cam_id": "screen_anchor",
   "push": false,
   "screen": "biff_poster"
  },
  {
   "who": "panel",
   "text": "BIFF. Like Biff from Back to the Future? The bully?",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_035.mp3",
   "shot": "k_screen",
   "cam_id": "screen_panel",
   "side": "left",
   "push": false,
   "screen": "biff_poster"
  },
  {
   "who": "anchor",
   "text": "No relation. It used to be called PIFF, with a P, from the old spelling, Pusan.",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_036.mp3",
   "shot": "k_screen",
   "cam_id": "screen_anchor",
   "push": false,
   "screen": "biff_poster"
  },
  {
   "who": "panel",
   "text": "One letter. Somebody had to reprint every T-shirt.",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_037.mp3",
   "shot": "k_screen",
   "cam_id": "screen_panel",
   "side": "left",
   "push": false,
   "screen": "biff_poster"
  },
  {
   "who": "anchor",
   "text": "It began in nineteen ninety-six, with a hundred seventy-three films from thirty-one countries. About a hundred eighty-four thousand people came.",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_038.mp3",
   "shot": "k_screen",
   "cam_id": "screen_anchor",
   "push": false,
   "screen": "y1996"
  },
  {
   "who": "panel",
   "text": "That's a lot of popcorn.",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_039.mp3",
   "shot": "k_screen",
   "cam_id": "screen_panel",
   "side": "left",
   "push": false,
   "screen": "y1996"
  },
  {
   "who": "anchor",
   "text": "It was the first international film festival in Korea. The opening film was \"Secrets and Lies,\" by the British director Mike Leigh.",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_040.mp3",
   "shot": "cam",
   "cam": [
    960,
    500,
    1.1
   ],
   "ease": 0.14,
   "cam_id": "two",
   "push": false
  },
  {
   "who": "panel",
   "text": "A British family drama to open a festival in Korea. That's range.",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_041.mp3",
   "shot": "cam",
   "cam": [
    960,
    500,
    1.1
   ],
   "ease": 0.14,
   "cam_id": "two",
   "push": false
  },
  {
   "who": "anchor",
   "text": "In twenty eleven, it moved to its permanent home, the Busan Cinema Center, in a district called Centum City.",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_042.mp3",
   "shot": "k_screen",
   "cam_id": "screen_anchor",
   "push": false,
   "screen": "biff_center"
  },
  {
   "who": "panel",
   "text": "A permanent home. For a festival, that's basically a mortgage.",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_043.mp3",
   "shot": "k_screen",
   "cam_id": "screen_panel",
   "side": "left",
   "push": false,
   "screen": "biff_center"
  },
  {
   "who": "anchor",
   "text": "In twenty fourteen, Busan was named a UNESCO City of Film. And in twenty twenty, during the pandemic, the festival showed a hundred ninety-two films to a total audience of about twenty thousand.",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_044.mp3",
   "shot": "k_screen",
   "cam_id": "screen_anchor",
   "push": false,
   "screen": "biff_time"
  },
  {
   "who": "panel",
   "text": "Twenty thousand. The popcorn must have been lonely.",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_045.mp3",
   "shot": "k_screen",
   "cam_id": "screen_panel",
   "side": "left",
   "push": false,
   "screen": "biff_time"
  },
  {
   "who": "anchor",
   "text": "Last year, for the thirtieth edition, it moved to September and added a competition section. The Grand Prize winner now closes the festival.",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_046.mp3",
   "shot": "cam",
   "cam": [
    960,
    500,
    1.1
   ],
   "ease": 0.14,
   "cam_id": "two",
   "push": false
  },
  {
   "who": "panel",
   "text": "So the festival ends with the winner. A festival with a built-in happy ending.",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_047.mp3",
   "shot": "cam",
   "cam": [
    960,
    500,
    1.1
   ],
   "ease": 0.14,
   "cam_id": "two",
   "push": false
  },
  {
   "who": "anchor",
   "text": "This year, it's back in October. Three hundred sixteen films from fifty-nine countries, including ninety-three world premieres.",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_048.mp3",
   "shot": "k_screen",
   "cam_id": "screen_anchor",
   "push": false,
   "screen": "films316"
  },
  {
   "who": "panel",
   "text": "Three hundred sixteen films in ten days. That's more than thirty films a day. Even I can't binge that.",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_049.mp3",
   "shot": "k_screen",
   "cam_id": "screen_panel",
   "side": "left",
   "push": false,
   "screen": "films316"
  },
  {
   "who": "anchor",
   "text": "The opening ceremony was on October sixth, at the outdoor theater. Michelle Yeoh received the Asian Filmmaker of the Year award.",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_050.mp3",
   "shot": "k_screen",
   "cam_id": "screen_anchor",
   "push": false,
   "screen": "yeoh"
  },
  {
   "who": "anchor",
   "text": "And there's a special program called \"Everything Everywhere All for Michelle.\"",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_051.mp3",
   "shot": "k_screen",
   "cam_id": "screen_anchor",
   "push": false,
   "screen": "yeoh"
  },
  {
   "who": "panel",
   "text": "Everything Everywhere All for Michelle. That's the best title I've heard all week.",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_052.mp3",
   "shot": "k_screen",
   "cam_id": "screen_panel",
   "side": "left",
   "push": false,
   "screen": "yeoh"
  },
  {
   "who": "anchor",
   "text": "The competition jury is presided over by the director Zhang Yimou. And among the guests are Alfonso Cuaron and Charlotte Gainsbourg.",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_053.mp3",
   "shot": "cam",
   "cam": [
    960,
    500,
    1.1
   ],
   "ease": 0.14,
   "cam_id": "two",
   "push": false
  },
  {
   "who": "anchor",
   "text": "There's also a program called \"Those Beautiful Years, Ahn Sung-ki,\" with six films of the late actor.",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_054.mp3",
   "shot": "cam",
   "cam": [
    960,
    500,
    1.1
   ],
   "ease": 0.14,
   "cam_id": "two",
   "push": false
  },
  {
   "who": "panel",
   "text": "That's a lovely way to remember him.",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_055.mp3",
   "shot": "cam",
   "cam": [
    960,
    500,
    1.1
   ],
   "ease": 0.14,
   "cam_id": "two",
   "push": false
  },
  {
   "who": "anchor",
   "text": "Some screenings are outdoors, at the Open Cinema. In October. So bring a jacket.",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_056.mp3",
   "shot": "cam",
   "cam": [
    960,
    500,
    1.1
   ],
   "ease": 0.14,
   "cam_id": "two",
   "push": false
  },
  {
   "who": "panel",
   "text": "A movie under the sky, in a jacket. That's my kind of date night.",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_057.mp3",
   "shot": "cam",
   "cam": [
    960,
    500,
    1.1
   ],
   "ease": 0.14,
   "cam_id": "two",
   "push": false
  },
  {
   "who": "anchor",
   "text": "Tickets are open to everyone, not just industry people. You book on the festival's ticket site, and leftover seats may be sold at ticket boxes on site.",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_058.mp3",
   "shot": "k_screen",
   "cam_id": "screen_anchor",
   "push": false,
   "screen": "tickets"
  },
  {
   "who": "guest",
   "text": "I once booked a ticket to a movie about travel. Does that count?",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_059.mp3",
   "shot": "k_screen",
   "cam_id": "screen_guest",
   "push": false,
   "screen": "tickets"
  },
  {
   "who": "anchor",
   "text": "No. Busan is about two and a half hours from Seoul by KTX.",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_060.mp3",
   "shot": "cam",
   "cam": [
    960,
    500,
    1.1
   ],
   "ease": 0.14,
   "cam_id": "two",
   "push": false
  },
  {
   "who": "panel",
   "text": "So your weekend is jazz on a turtle island, or films in a port city. Or both, if you have a jet pack.",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_061.mp3",
   "shot": "cam",
   "cam": [
    960,
    500,
    1.1
   ],
   "ease": 0.14,
   "cam_id": "two",
   "push": false
  },
  {
   "who": "anchor",
   "text": "Dates can change, so check each festival's official site before you go.",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_062.mp3",
   "shot": "cam",
   "cam": [
    960,
    500,
    1.1
   ],
   "ease": 0.14,
   "cam_id": "two",
   "push": false
  },
  {
   "who": "panel",
   "text": "Core, which one are you going to?",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_063.mp3",
   "shot": "cam",
   "cam": [
    960,
    500,
    1.1
   ],
   "ease": 0.14,
   "cam_id": "two",
   "push": false
  },
  {
   "who": "anchor",
   "text": "I will be at home. With a spreadsheet. That was your Korea events guide. Thanks for watching.",
   "audio": "audio/v1/ep05_064.mp3",
   "shot": "cam",
   "cam": [
    960,
    500,
    1.1
   ],
   "ease": 0.14,
   "cam_id": "two",
   "push": false
  }
 ],
 "out_long": "render/ep05_s2_long.mp4",
